  "limitations": [
    "These are published results, not measurements made by this application.",
    "The workload, machine, versions and memory accounting differ from the application container benchmark; do not use these figures to rank it or calculate an efficiency multiple.",
    "Only observations from the same batch share the reported machine conditions. No cross-machine CPU adjustment is applied.",
    "No memory limit or memory-exhaustion session capacity is reported. A first-session or per-session figure is not a capacity result.",
    "Upstream labels binary megabytes as MB; its code divides bytes by 1024 squared. Values below use MiB without changing the numeric value.",
    "Supported features, persistence, editor integration and authentication are not held equal. No feature-equivalence claim is made."
